   "text": "**Year:** The Data Center Perg was opened in 2010. The operator's own history page says eww ITandTEL opened its Green Data Center in Perg that year, and the Technologiezentrum Perg (where the facility sits) describes the data centre as built in 2010 through a joint venture of three partners. The operator's page is the strongest source.\n\n**Area:** I found no floor area for the data centre itself. The Technologiezentrum Perg site gives the upper floor of its Bauteil 2 as about 400 m² of usable space, but it does not say how much of that the data centre occupies. A directory listing gives a building footprint of 18,309 sq ft (about 1,701 m²). That listing places the facility in Linz and may describe the wider Technologiezentrum building, so I treat it as low confidence.\n\n```json\n{\"year\": 2010, \"year_type\": \"opened\", \"year_source_url\": \"https://www.eww.at/detail-itandtel/hirn-herz-hightech-30-jahre-eww-itandtel-wir-feiern-30-jahre-kundenvertrauen\", \"year_source_type\": \"company_website\", \"area_value\": 18309, \"area_unit\": \"sq_ft\", \"area_type\": \"building\", \"area_source_url\": \"https://www.datacenterjournal.com/data-centers/austria/linz/itandtel-perg/\", \"area_source_type\": \"directory\", \"match_confidence\": \"low\"}\n```",
